      "id": "get-name",
      "name": "GetName",
      "category": "DerivedDataBuildOutput",
      "signature": "GetName()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "FSharedString&",
      "docs": "A build output log is a log message captured from a build function.\nThe build function may capture every log above a certain level of verbosity, which means these\nhave no guarantee of being deterministic. The presence of any output logs will disable caching\nof the build output. To allow caching of build output with warnings or errors, replace the log\nstatements with build messages that are added to the build context."
    },
    {
